      industryBenchmarks: '2025 data; triangulated across Upwork, Toptal, Glassdoor, Payscale, Braintree, Freelancers Union, IRS self-employment tax tables, and Stripe Atlas solopreneur surveys. Updated annually per Topic review cadence.',
